      "title": "Method validation",
      "instruction": "The CARI index demonstrates a strong performance in detecting crops, achieving an accuracy of 73% (Fig. 5). On the other hand, the MSAVI index excels in crop detection, boasting the highest crop prediction accuracy of 85%. Similarly, the SAVI index also shows excellent performance in crop prediction, with an accuracy of 86%, making it the most accurate among the three indices. Both MSAVI and SAVI share the strength of high crop detection accuracy, with SAVI having a slight edge over MSAVI.Fig. 5Prediction accuracies of soft classified CARI, MSAVI and SAVI.Fig 5:",
